<!-- 
  MASTER SERVER CONFIGURATION FILE
  
  Purpose: Central configuration file hosted on a server that all client machines fetch from.
  This file contains entries for MULTIPLE machine types (Workstation-A, Server-B, Server-C, etc.)
  
  Each client machine will:
  1. Download this file from the server
  2. Filter to only files matching its own PCType
  3. Use those files for monitoring
  
  Location: http://your-master-server/checksum/config.xml
  Example: http://fileserver.example.com/config/master-config.xml
  
  Served by: IIS, Apache, or any web server
  File Permissions: Read access for all clients
-->

